<title>USA: PepsiCo Inc Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>PepsiCo Inc Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.09		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net			144,000		  617,000</p>
<p> Revs		   7,867,000		7,648,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,607,000		1,607,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.69		    $0.89</p>
<p> Net		    1,121,000		1,425,000</p>
<p> Revs		  22,112,000	     21,050,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     1,613,000		1,604,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for quarter was $0.31 per share.</p>
<p>1996 results include a one-time charge of $390 million associated with the international beverage operation.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
